*** Keywords ***
CB007012_uDTX_single_cell_operation_varying_load
    [Documentation]  The purpose of this test case is verification of uDTX function (with 10% and 20% load
    ...              in DL direction). The test case is performed for each cell separately.
    ...              - cell_ids     - list of CONFIG lte cell ids for which test case should be performed.
    ...                               Example: [1, 2, 3, 4, 5] or ["1", "2", "3", "4", "5"].
    ...              - call_duration  - duration of data transfer test in seconds e.g. ‘300s’.
    ...              - throughput_10  - dict with throughput (10% load) and deviation values for each cell identified by
    ...                                 it's nrCellIdentity for NR cells, eutranCellId for LTE cells, wnCelId for WCDMA cells.
    ...                                 Example:
    ...                                 {
    ...                                     '827736065':
    ...                                          {
    ...                                              'throughput':
    ...                                                  {
    ...                                                      'downlink': '100 Mbits/sec',
    ...                                                      'uplink': '0 Mbits/sec'
    ...                                                  },
    ...                                              'deviation': '90%'
    ...                                          },
    ...                                 }
    ...               - throughput_20  - dict with throughput (20% load) and deviation values for each cell identified by
    ...                                  it's nrCellIdentity for NR cells, eutranCellId for LTE cells, wnCelId for WCDMA cells.
    ...               - protocol - data transfer protocol; defaults to UDP.
    ...               - udp_buffer - monitoring data buffer; defaults to 4M.
    ...               - expected_reduction  -  expected power reduction (in percents %) on RU after enabling power saving feature,
    ...                                        defaults to 10.
    [Arguments]                                        ${cell_ids}
    ...                                                ${call_duration}
    ...                                                ${throughput_10}
    ...                                                ${throughput_20}
    ...                                                ${protocol}=udp
    ...                                                ${udp_buffer}=4M
    ...                                                ${expected_reduction}=10

    ${bts_type}=                                       hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}                                      connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                                bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${rat_cell_ids}=                                   admin_info_model.get_cell_ids_from_specific_rat
    ...                                                connection=${connection}
    ...                                                cell_type=lte
    &{cells_dist_names}                                Create Dictionary
    Configure Power Meter                              bts_type=${bts_type}

    FOR  ${cell_id}  IN  @{rat_cell_ids}
          ${cell_dist_names}                           admin_info_model.get_dist_names_for_specific_cell
          ...                                          connection=${connection}
          ...                                          cell_type=lte
          ...                                          cell_id=${cell_id}
          ${str_cell_id}                               Convert To String  ${cell_id}
          Set To Dictionary                            ${cells_dist_names}  ${str_cell_id}=${cell_dist_names}
    END
    
    FOR  ${cell_id}  IN  @{cell_ids}
          ${rmod_id}                                   admin_info_model.get_rmod_ids_for_cell_id
          ...                                          connection=${connection}
          ...                                          cell_id=${cell_id}
          ...                                          cell_type=lte
          uDTX Traffic Loads                           bts_type=${bts_type}
          ...                                          connection=${connection}
          ...                                          cell_dist_names=${cells_dist_names["""${cell_id}"""]}
          ...                                          rmod_id=${rmod_id}
          ...                                          call_duration=${call_duration}
          ...                                          throughput_10=${throughput_10}
          ...                                          throughput_20=${throughput_20}
          ...                                          protocol=${protocol}
          ...                                          udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
          ...                                          expected_reduction=${expected_reduction}
    END
    [Teardown]                                         Run Keywords
    ...                                                Configure Power Meter
    ...                                                enable=${False}
    ...                                                bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                                AND
    ...                                                tempere.close_connection
    ...                                                AND
    ...                                                Clean Up Environment

uDTX Traffic Loads
    [Arguments]                                        ${bts_type}
    ...                                                ${connection}
    ...                                                ${cell_dist_names}
    ...                                                ${rmod_id}
    ...                                                ${call_duration}
    ...                                                ${throughput_10}
    ...                                                ${throughput_20}
    ...                                                ${protocol}
    ...                                                ${udp_buffer}
    ...                                                ${expected_reduction}

    ${traffic_loads}                                   Create List   ${throughput_10}   ${throughput_20}
    Disable Broadcasts                                 bts_type=${bts_type}

    FOR  ${traffic_load}   IN  @{traffic_loads}
         Traffic Load Validation                      bts_type=${bts_type}
          ...                                          cell_dist_names=${cell_dist_names}
          ...                                          rmod_id=${rmod_id}
          ...                                          call_duration=${call_duration}
          ...                                          throughput=${traffic_load}
          ...                                          protocol=${protocol}
          ...                                          udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
          ...                                          expected_reduction=${expected_reduction}
    END
    [Teardown]                                         Ensure Power Saving Is Enabled
    ...                                                cell_dist_names=${cell_dist_names}
    ...                                                bts_type=${bts_type}


Traffic Load Validation
    [Arguments]                                        ${bts_type}
    ...                                                ${cell_dist_names}
    ...                                                ${rmod_id}
    ...                                                ${call_duration}
    ...                                                ${throughput}
    ...                                                ${protocol}
    ...                                                ${udp_buffer}
    ...                                                ${expected_reduction}
    Configure Power Saving                             config_cell_dist_name=${cell_dist_names["configuration"]}
    ...                                                allowTrafficConcentration=${False}
    ...                                                actMicroDtx=${False}
    ...                                                bts_type=${bts_type}
    Sleep                                              5 min        Reason=Waiting for changes to be noticable
    ${ru_power_usage_without_udtx}                     Get Power Usage During L3 Call
    ...                                                called_cell=${cell_dist_names['configuration']}
    ...                                                direction=DL
    ...                                                call_duration=${call_duration}
    ...                                                throughput=${throughput}
    ...                                                protocol=${protocol}
    ...                                                udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
    ...                                                bts_type=${bts_type}

    Robot log step                                     Enabling uDTX feature...
    Configure Power Saving                             config_cell_dist_name=${cell_dist_names["configuration"]}
    ...                                                bts_type=${bts_type}
    Sleep                                              5 min        Reason=Waiting for changes to be noticable
    ${ru_power_usage_with_udtx}                        Get Power Usage During L3 Call
    ...                                                called_cell=${cell_dist_names['configuration']}
    ...                                                direction=DL
    ...                                                call_duration=${call_duration}
    ...                                                throughput=${throughput}
    ...                                                protocol=${protocol}
    ...                                                udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
    ...                                                bts_type=${bts_type}

    Robot log operation                                Validating if power usage was increased for enabled uDTX feature...
    power_usage.validate_power_usage_change            start_power_usage=${ru_power_usage_without_udtx}
    ...                                                end_power_usage=${ru_power_usage_with_udtx}
    ...                                                expected_reduction=${expected_reduction}
    ...                                                rmod_id=${rmod_id}
